{
  "schema": "lgpe-gamedata-v1",
  "format": "LGPE-message",
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "id": "msg_main0805_poke_01_01",
      "hash": "67195e63266b521b",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "幽靈「……離開吧。"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "id": "msg_main0805_poke_01_02",
      "hash": "67195f63266b53ce",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "從這裡……離開吧……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_01",
      "hash": "1fb7dc95783b3aa0",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「呃！\\n又來了一隻更大的……！"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_10",
      "hash": "1fb477957838592a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，用那個！\\n快用剛才的那個！"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "id": "msg_main0805_sys_01",
      "hash": "98a1dd67f92a9f67",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "原來幽靈的真面目是……\\c\\n卡拉卡拉的母親\\n四處徘徊的靈魂！"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "id": "msg_main0805_sys_02",
      "hash": "98a1de67f92aa11a",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡拉卡拉母親的靈魂\\n變回了原本溫柔的樣子。\\c\\n安祥地升上天空……\\n然後就這樣消失了……"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_02",
      "hash": "1fb7df95783b3fb9",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「卡拉卡拉你\\n原來是因為想見媽媽\\r\\n才到這裡來的啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "id": "msg_main0805_poke_02_01",
      "hash": "123c266d35d38b24",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡拉卡拉「咖嗚……"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_03",
      "hash": "1fb7de95783b3e06",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「我竟然那麼\\n怕你媽媽，真對不起。"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_04",
      "hash": "1fb7e195783b431f",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，我……\\n我不想讓卡拉卡拉覺得孤單，\\r\\n所以我要送牠回家。\\c\\n對了！[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳如果在上層\\n遇到那個叫富士的人，\\r\\n可以幫忙把他帶回家嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "id": "msg_main0805_select_01",
      "hash": "db48292ea2290a98",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "你一個人回得去嗎？"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "id": "msg_main0805_select_02",
      "hash": "db482c2ea2290fb1",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "交給我吧！"
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_05",
      "hash": "1fb7e095783b416c",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「沒、沒問題啦！\\n卡拉卡拉也在嘛。\\c\\n……[VAR TRNAME(0000)][VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳真是\\n越來越靠得住了啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_06",
      "hash": "1fb7e395783b4685",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR TRNAME(0001)]「[VAR TRNAME(0000)]，\\n[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳一點都不怕嗎？\\c\\n看[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳那充滿自信的樣子，\\n感覺真可靠啊……"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_07",
      "hash": "1fb7e295783b44d2",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "什麼！？是[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳從火箭隊手裡\\n把卡拉卡拉救出來的！？"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_11",
      "hash": "1fb4789578385add",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳是什麼時候\\n變得那麼厲害啦……"
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_08",
      "hash": "1fb7e595783b49eb",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "……好吧，既然如此，\\n就拜託[VAR GENDBR(00FF,0101)]你妳囉！"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "id": "msg_main0805_rival_09",
      "hash": "1fb7e495783b4838",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "好，我們走，卡拉卡拉！"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "id": "msg_main0805_poke_02_02",
      "hash": "123c296d35d3903d",
      "flags": 0,
      "text": "卡拉卡拉「咖嗚！"
    }
  ],
  "unpaired_labels": [
    {
      "id": "msg_main_event_0805_max",
      "hash": "29a8cb780fbc5a6c"
    }
  ]
}
